     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi everyone,</div><div> </div><div>This summer I ran a test study to see if snorkeling fish counts could produce population estimates for a side channel.  I broke the side channel into habitat units (24) and resampled the site four times.  I used covariates for habitat type, snorkel pass, time of snorkel, average depth, length, and area.  I did not include the covariate data to save space.</div><div> </div><div> </div><div>I have pasted my age-0 fish count data below.     </div><div> </div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">R &lt;- 23</font></font></font></p><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>J &lt;- 4 <u></u><u></u><u></u></font></font></font><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font></p><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>y&lt;-matrix(c(<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>6,6,17,22,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>105,57,82,88,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>30,24,45,15,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>5,5,14,1,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>15,4,25,5,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>6,5,17,7,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>2,0,5,11,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>10,40,38,28,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>10,16,41,17,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>38,24,70,52,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>0,1,1,2,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>12,30,22,21,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>50,40,65,78,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>7,22,45,27,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>80,53,75,8,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>22,1,27,7,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>5,8,2,5,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>35,1,24,24,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>2,0,0,0,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>24,0,0,10,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>0,0,0,0,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>0,0,0,0,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>0,0,0,0),nrow=R, ncol=J, byrow=TRUE)<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font></div><div>  </div><div> </div><div>I am wondering if it is ok to use a ZIP model when you do not have a lot of zeros in your data?  When I ran the global  P model  my c.hat showed that my data is highly overdispersed (C.hat &gt;10), so I am reluctant to convert to QAIC and rank these models.  I tried the NB models but every time I increase my K, my population would increase and never seemed to stabilize.    When I ran ZIP models, I got the lowest AIC values and my data was not over dispersed.   Does anyone see a reason why I should not use the ZIP models?  I have pasted the top five results for the ZIP and P models below.</div><div> </div><div> </div><div> </div><div><table width=\"758\" style=\"width:569pt;border-collapse:collapse\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n\r\n <colgroup><col width=\"64\" style=\"width:48pt\">\r\n <col width=\"120\" style=\"width:90pt\">\r\n <col width=\"64\" style=\"width:48pt\" span=\"3\">\r\n <col width=\"318\" style=\"width:239pt\">\r\n <col width=\"64\" style=\"width:48pt\">\r\n <tbody><tr height=\"20\" style=\"height:15pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"64\" height=\"20\" style=\"border:0px black;width:48pt;height:15pt;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">model </font></td>\r\n  <td width=\"120\" style=\"border:0px black;width:90pt;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">model number</font></td>\r\n  <td width=\"64\" style=\"border:0px black;width:48pt;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">nPars</font></td>\r\n  <td width=\"64\" style=\"border:0px black;width:48pt;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">AIC</font></td>\r\n  <td width=\"64\" style=\"border:0px black;width:48pt;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"></font></td>\r\n  <td width=\"318\" style=\"border:0px black;width:239pt;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"></font></td>\r\n  <td width=\"64\" style=\"border:0px black;width:48pt;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"></font></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"20\" style=\"height:15pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"20\" style=\"border:0px black;height:15pt;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">zip</font></td>\r\n  <td style=\"border:0px black;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">m53</font></td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\" style=\"border:0px black;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">17</font></td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\" style=\"border:0px black;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">1128.38</font></td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\" style=\"border:0px black;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"></font></td>\r\n  <td style=\"border:0px black;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"></font></td>\r\n  <td style=\"border:0px black;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"></font></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"20\" style=\"height:15pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"20\" style=\"border:0px black;height:15pt;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">zip</font></td>\r\n  <td style=\"border:0px black;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">m1</font></td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\" style=\"border:0px black;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">17</font></td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\" style=\"border:0px black;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">1128.38</font></td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\" style=\"border:0px black;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"></font></td>\r\n  <td style=\"border:0px black;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"></font></td>\r\n  <td style=\"border:0px black;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"></font></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"20\" style=\"height:15pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"20\" style=\"border:0px black;height:15pt;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">zip</font></td>\r\n  <td style=\"border:0px black;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">m55</font></td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\" style=\"border:0px black;background-color:transparent\"><font color=