1</font></td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\" style=\"border:0px black;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">21</font></td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\" style=\"border:0px black;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">1132.44</font></td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\" style=\"border:0px black;background-color:transparent\"><p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"></font> </p><p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"></font> </p></td>\r\n  <td style=\"border:0px black;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"></font></td>\r\n  <td style=\"border:0px black;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"></font></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n\r\n</tbody></colgroup></table></div><div>P               m54                           17             1190.76</div><div>P               m53                           18             1196.37</div><div>P               m1                             20             1196.41</div><div>P               m55                           18             1208.99</div><div>P               m51                           16             1212.06</div><div> </div><div> </div><div> </div><div> </div><div> </div><div> </div><div> </div><div> </div><div> </div><div> </div><div>   </div></div>"
