  {
   "id": "wE2uDWX4y28J",
   "from": "Jeffrey Royle",
   "author": "4a15de51da4445ae",
   "date": "2013-12-30T23:26:10Z",
   "subject": "Re: [unmarked] ZIP models with little or no zeros",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>hi Kyle,</div><div> yes it would be ok to use the ZIP model in this case, although it should estimate a small fraction of zeros obviously.</div><div> The bigger problem is that the within-site counts are distinctly not binomial, and when you try to soak up that variation by modeling variation in N then you wind up with this severe numerical instability problem that you noted. </div>\r\n<div> It would be better to pursue other observation models besides the binomial but we can&#39;t do that in unmarked (not because its not easy to do but, rather, because we probably won&#39;t get around to writing code for it anytime soon!).</div>\r\n<div>regards</div><div>andy</div><div> </div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Mon, Dec 30, 2013 at 4:39 PM, Kyle <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">kyle_m...@hotmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br>\r\n</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi everyone,</div><div> </div><div>This summer I ran a test study to see if snorkeling fish counts could produce population estimates for a side channel.  I broke the side channel into habitat units (24) and resampled the site four times.  I used covariates for habitat type, snorkel pass, time of snorkel, average depth, length, and area.  I did not include the covariate data to save space.</div>\r\n<div> </div><div> </div><div>I have pasted my age-0 fish count data below.     </div><div> </div><div><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">R &lt;- 23</font></font></font></p><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>J &lt;- 4 <u></u><u></u><u></u></font></font></font><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font></p><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>y&lt;-matrix(c(<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>6,6,17,22,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>105,57,82,88,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>30,24,45,15,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>5,5,14,1,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>15,4,25,5,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>6,5,17,7,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>2,0,5,11,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>10,40,38,28,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>10,16,41,17,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>38,24,70,52,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>0,1,1,2,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>12,30,22,21,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>50,40,65,78,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>7,22,45,27,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>80,53,75,8,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>22,1,27,7,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>5,8,2,5,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>35,1,24,24,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>2,0,0,0,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>24,0,0,10,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>0,0,0,0,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>0,0,0,0,<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:1em 0px;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span> </span>0,0,0,0),nrow=R, ncol=J, byrow=TRUE)<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font></div><div>  </div><div> </div><div>I am wondering if it is ok to use a ZIP model when you do not have a lot of zeros in your data?  When I ran the global  P model  my c.hat showed that my data is highly overdispersed (C.hat &gt;10), so I am reluctant to convert to QAIC and rank these models.  I tried the NB models but every time I increase my K, my population would increase and never seemed to stabilize.    When I ran ZIP models, I got the lowest AIC values and my data was not over dispersed.   Does anyone see a reason why I should not use the ZIP models?  I have pasted the top five results for the ZIP and P models below.</div>\r\n<div> </div><div> </div><div> </div><div><table style=\"width:569pt;border-collapse:collapse\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"758\">\r\n\r\n <colgroup><col style=\"width:48pt\" width=\"64\">\r\n <col style=\"width:90pt\" width=\"120\">\r\n <col style=\"width:48pt\" span=\"3\" width=\"64\">\r\n <col style=\"width:239pt\" width=\"318\">\r\n <col style=\"width:48pt\" width=\"64\">\r\n <tbody><tr style=\"height:15pt\" height=\"20\">\r\n  <td style=\"border:0px black;width:48pt;height:15pt;background-color:transparent\" height=\"20\" width=\"64\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri\">model </font></td>\r\n  <td style=\"border:0px black;width:90pt;background-color:transparent\" width=\"120\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri\">model number</font></td>\r\n  <td style=\"border:0px black;width:48pt;background-color:transparent\" width=\"64\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri\">nPars</font></td>\r\n  <td style=\"border:0px black;width:48pt;background-color:transparent\" width=\"64\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri\">AIC</font></td>\r\n  <td style=\"border:0px black;width:48pt;background-color:transparent\" width=\"64\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri\"></font></td>\r\n  <td style=\"border:0px black;width:239pt;background-color:transparent\" width=\"318\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri\"></font></td>\r\n  <td style=\"border:0px black;width:48pt;background-color:transparent\" width=\"64\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri\"></font></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"height:15pt\" height=\"20\">\r\n  <td style=\"border:0px black;height:15pt;background-color:transparent\" height=\"20\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri\">zip</font></td>\r\n  <td style=\"border:0px black;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri\">m53</font></td>\r\n  <td style=\"border:0px blac